귄 퓨리는 로그라이트 오토배틀러입니다. 펍귄을 영입하고 합체해 더 강한 형태로 진화시키며, 무기를 장착해 끝없이 몰아치는 물결 속으로 내보내세요. 처치를 연결해 광란에서 신급까지 올라가고, 6개 시대에 걸친 70개의 스킨을 해금하며, 매 판을 한 물결씩 더 멀리 밀어붙이세요. 매 판마다 조합과 빌드가 달라져 같은 전투는 두 번 나오지 않습니다. 당신은 어디까지 버퓴 수 있을까요?","publishers":[{"name":"exklusiva","creator_clan_account_id":46238406}],"developers":[{"name":"exklusiva","creator_clan_account_id":46238406}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793970000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"게임플레이 영상","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1786980686","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5042320/568432869/5bd909cc66c63aa0679d2279df1719fe9fd4f931/1786560954/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5042320/568432869/5bd909cc66c63aa0679d2279df1719fe9fd4f931/1786560954/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"5042320/568432869/5bd909cc66c63aa0679d2279df1719fe9fd4f931/1786560954/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"5042320/568432869/5bd909cc66c63aa0679d2279df1719fe9fd4f931/1786560954/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"5042320/568432869/5bd909cc66c63aa0679d2279df1719fe9fd4f931/1786560954/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257397635/c4b85b93ae2cf91512b9c4fae77610b2cebb113b/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257397635/c4b85b93ae2cf91512b9c4fae77610b2cebb113b/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1284203,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_errors":{},"developers":["exklusiva"],"publishers":["exklusiva"],"release":{"steam_release_date":1793970000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"게임플레이 영상","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1786980686","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5042320/568432869/5bd909cc66c63aa0679d2279df1719fe9fd4f931/17865609